<BaseLayout title="About — AVERY" description="About Avery, an independent developer.">
  <section class="page-hero section-wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="prompt">›_</span> SYSTEM / ABOUT</p>
    <h1>Just me, and a <span class="red">terminal.</span></h1>
    <p>I'm Avery, an independent developer interested in software, operating systems, bots, and web projects.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-wrap detail-grid">
    <article class="detail-panel"><span class="section-index">[ ABOUT ]</span><h2>What I do</h2><p>I enjoy building things from the ground up, learning how systems work, and turning ideas into useful software. My projects span operating-system development, Discord bots, and web experiences.</p><p>This site is a home for my projects, releases, and development notes.</p></article>
    <aside class="detail-panel"><span class="section-index">[ CURRENT INTERESTS ]</span><ul class="interest-list"><li>Operating-system development</li><li>Developer tools and automation</li><li>Discord bots and integrations</li><li>Web design and open-source software</li></ul><a class="button button-secondary full-button" href="https://github.com/MaseDev33" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub profile ↗</a></aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
